00:01:16.695 --> 00:01:22.665
Zoe T: I know that PACS is a speech and
language therapy derived intervention.

00:01:23.495 --> 00:01:26.865
And it's very much like intensive
interaction in the sense that

00:01:26.955 --> 00:01:28.875
it's follows the child's lead.

00:01:30.285 --> 00:01:35.055
RDI also does that to begin with,
but then moves on to enable the

00:01:35.055 --> 00:01:38.475
adult guide to lead the child,
but in a declarative sort of way.

00:01:38.745 --> 00:01:42.965
Zoe: Using social stories can be really
helpful for children, especially when

00:01:42.965 --> 00:01:46.835
they're about to experience a situation
that they've not experienced before.

00:01:47.015 --> 00:01:49.895
It can make sure you've taken them
